@startuml agentic-offering-value-stream-boundary
title Agentic Offering / Agentic Value Stream Boundary ; per ADR-ES-018 §12

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic Value Stream" as AVS
class "Agentic Offering" as AO

AVS --> AO : may involve

note right
  Per ADR-ES-018 §12 + AOFF-NEG-006:
  - Agentic Offering is NOT Agentic Value Stream
  - Agentic Value Stream is NOT Agentic Offering
  - An Agentic Offering may participate in conventional, Agentic, or Autonomous Value Stream
end note

@enduml
